dvdnav.library: changes
=======================

1.7 (17 November 2026)
----------------------

- Renamed from amcedvd.library, and moved from AmigaMCE's repository to
  its own: dvdnav.library, <libraries/dvdnav.h>, dvdnav_lib.sfd,
  DvdNavBase, DVDNAVLIB_NAME and DVDNAVLIB_VERSION (DVDNAV_ is libdvdnav's
  own). The calls, structures and events are unchanged.
- GPL-3.0-or-later (libdvdread and libdvdnav inside are GPL-2.0-or-later).

As amcedvd.library, in AmigaMCE:

1.6 (15 November 2026)
- DVDU_PREV_CHAPTER says when there is no chapter before.

1.5 (15 November 2026)
- DVD_JUMPED (a DVDE_HOP flag): a jump said at once, so the player drops
  what it has read.

1.4 (15 November 2026)
- cssdecrypt.library held only while a disc that asked for it is open, so
  a newer copy in the program's Libs is the one used next.

1.3 (14 November 2026)
- An optional cssdecrypt.library opened where libdvdread would load
  libdvdcss.

1.2 (14 November 2026)
- DvdMenus: which menus the disc has.

1.1 (14 November 2026)
- Seeks across the whole title.

1.0 (14 November 2026)
- First version: libdvdread 7.1.1 and libdvdnav 7.0.0 behind the Dvd*
  calls, for discs and images.
